### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:40000/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "user1",
    "password": "1234"
}

###

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Cadastrar pasto
# @name novoPasto
POST http://localhost:40000/insertPasto
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "descricao": "Pasto Central",
    "areatotal": 25.50
}

###

@pastoId = {{novoPasto.response.body.$.id}}

### Listar todos os pastos
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPastos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Consultar pasto por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getPastoByID/{{pastoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Atualizar pasto
PUT http://localhost:40000/updatePasto/{{pastoId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "descricao": "Pasto Central Atualizado",
    "areatotal": 28.00
}

###

### Testar ID inválido
GET http://localhost:40000/getPastoByID/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Testar acesso sem JWT
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllPastos

###

### Excluir pasto logicamente
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deletePasto/{{pastoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}